## `ge` follows links ##

Execute (a heading may open with markup and close with hashes):
  normal ge
  AssertEqual 3, line('.')

Given markdown;
[jump](#slug)

custom target

Execute (user anchorexpr takes precedence and can still search arbitrary text):
  let g:vim_markdown_anchorexpr = 'substitute(v:anchor, "slug", "custom target", "")'
  normal ge
  AssertEqual 3, line('.')

Given markdown;
